# Resume Scanner AI — Run Commands

## Start Backend

Open terminal inside:

Backend/

Run:

```bash
python -m uvicorn app:app --reload
```

Expected:

```bash
Application startup complete
```

Backend runs on:

http://127.0.0.1:8000

---

## Start Frontend

Open terminal inside:

frontend/

Run:

```bash
npm start
```

Frontend runs on:

http://localhost:3000

---

## Important

Backend must run FIRST.

Then start frontend.

---

## Full Architecture

React Frontend
↓
FastAPI Backend
↓
ML Model (model.pkl + vectorizer.pkl)

---

## Common Fixes

### If backend says:

```bash
ModuleNotFoundError
```

Run:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

### If frontend says:

```bash
npm not found
```

Install:

Node.js

---

### If prediction fails

Check:

* backend terminal running
* model.pkl exists in Backend/
* vectorizer.pkl exists in Backend/
* CORS added in app.py

